{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Music by SHINE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592620/extras/shinelogo.png?t=1742508537\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The soon-to-be music phenomenon SHINE provides the music with the \u00abSounds From The Afterlife - Concept Album For Messorem\u00bb. The norwegian 8-piece delivers an astounding 65+ minutes of live orchestrated music that paints the world of the game with a magical assortment of sounds, genres-variety and instrumentation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592620/extras/band-expor3t.png?t=1742508537\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SHINE brings the action and drama to new levels with the two vocal-tracks \u00abThe Final Hour\u00bb and \u00abShimmer\u00bb. From blistering speed-metal to folky J-pop undertones, the band delivers audible spectacle like no first-time Indie game has ever seen (or in this case heard) before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All purchases goes directly to the band!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592620?t=1742508537","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592620?t=1742508537","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592620/19609e69beba292163feff6fee5a47f4418717e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742508537","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592620/19609e69beba292163feff6fee5a47f4418717e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742508537","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Music by SHINE</strong></p><